Package: taiga
Title: The Taiga Design System for 'Shiny', 'Quarto' and HTML
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Taiga", "maintainers", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "taiga@example.org")
Description: The Taiga design system, extracted from six Taiga applications
    (QuantSkill, lumenJourney, DirectoR, RockShiny, teal_neue, BlockR), in two
    frameworks: 'Lumen' (cinematic, high-contrast, glass-driven) and 'Neue'
    (minimalist, high-density enterprise). Ships the styleguides, the
    requirements for new projects and the delivery model as guides; design
    token sheets as CSS files, R vectors, an HTML dependency and a 'bslib'
    theme; the design values extracted from each application; WCAG contrast
    tools; and helpers for the triple-format delivery model, in which one
    front end ships as a 'Shiny' app, a 'Quarto' document and a standalone
    HTML file.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
